  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/05/IMG_2888.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Artistas locales, con la novedad de traducci&oacute;n al lenguaje de signos de palabras, canciones e incluso m&uacute;sica, el Ballet Jove de la Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia de Onda y la academia de baile On Dance de l&#39;Alcora, bajo la coordinaci&oacute;n del locutor Ram&oacute;n Cabedo Esteve, han protagonizado la gala de Manos Unidas (264 fotos),</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/05/IMG_9340.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>que ha cerrado con &eacute;xito su rastrillo anual (17 fotos).</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/galamansunides2016/img_2731.jpg\" alt=\"img_2731\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/galamansunides2016/img_2732.jpg\" alt=\"img_2732\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/galamansunides2016/img_2734.jpg\" alt=\"img_2734\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/galamansunides2016/img_2736.jpg\" alt=\"img_2736\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/galamansunides2016/img_2738.jpg\" alt=\"img_2738\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/galamansunides2016/img_2739.jpg\" alt=\"img_2739\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/galamansunides2016/img_2740.jpg\" alt=\"img_2740\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/galamansunides2016/img_2741.